{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c176a85e6189d8fcaac6d18c71edaa3cd6e4f55e87d2588a341a30628c5f360b", "ja": "オーディションに落ちたことを気にする翼を\n慰める瑞希。そんな二人がジュリアのソロ曲\n公演のバックコーラスを務めることになるが\n翼の不真面目な練習態度にジュリアは苛立ち\n軋轢が生じてしまう。", "zh": "瑞希安慰着在意自己落选试镜的翼。  \n这样的两人将担任茱莉亚个人曲  \n演出的伴唱，但茱莉亚因翼敷衍的练习态度而感到恼火，  \n两人之间也因此产生了摩擦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "db3728bd97672c5ba29ce0a33275a35268d718f45d09ed24adcb122ae43537fe", "ja": "み～ずきちゃんっ！　それ何してるの～？", "zh": "瑞～希！　你在做什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "4adad10b15c42d38b0d1d335ffe3e189e0871f798dd2278824b92a8cbf5d4a29", "ja": "これは……トランプタワーを作っています。\n伊吹さんもやってみますか？", "zh": "这是……在搭纸牌塔。\n伊吹小姐也要试试吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b9b40151acfec0fd7548287e708a05e476a7e226ebf4ee8cd374e3715e06dfd3", "ja": "～～♪　あっ。", "zh": "～～♪ 啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1005_null", "source_sha256": "f635caf5e96242300f044d3d358028381eea319019183dfbc4ec031c5c619207", "ja": "パタタ……", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "234304c9d90f5997bdc56286cc5f3ae2935a87e2f3f391a27901a86d6cbd2e19", "ja": "あ～……。", "zh": "啊～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "698483f1a1b31856860d04b57bccb23fa107825dd20c0525d935f3e228f54833", "ja": "コツはそっと、優しく、スピーディに。\nさりげなく、支えてあげるのです。", "zh": "诀窍就是轻轻地、温柔地、迅速地。\n要不着痕迹地帮助对方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a38a7aba15495c8c3a68a09a5bb83fb12d945722c805b35e0e655de2d1683c0", "ja": "すっご～い！　瑞希ちゃんって器用だよね～。\n…………。", "zh": "好厉害～！瑞希很灵巧呢～。\n…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "d1786308f4354b9acbd3fd6a8702b0fdbe726f9e9d034ab86577db975f6efdc8", "ja": "ため息……。伊吹さんが珍しいです。\nオーディションの日から、元気もないようです。", "zh": "叹气……伊吹小姐这样还真少见。  \n从试镜那天起，她好像就一直没什么精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b56f5dc88107e1a2bb7934cda8ba4b3ebb6b2a21234c6ce0aa0b60e91f41cb6d", "ja": "わたし絶対受かりたかったんだもん。\nでも美希先輩が駄目だって。", "zh": "人家真的很想合格嘛。\n可是美希前辈却说不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "37c2c77e3a4c7a6e4ba99131b583f57594cf3a73e2355d7df7e5ea05c994a1a4", "ja": "わたし、何がいけなかったのかなあ。", "zh": "我到底哪里做得不对呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "492e8e46d90538091528e3ab8158e2d82fd55910a2676bc14a87dc758c5be789", "ja": "おーっす。翼も一緒なら話は早えや。\nちょっと相談聞いてくれるか？", "zh": "嗨。既然翼也在，那就好办了。\n能听我商量件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "0b21baf9d27a5ecf2af0fd2a7cb4262640d5c034456e0ab6a2e4823fbbb92039", "ja": "定期ライブのあたしのソロ曲なんだけど。\n今回ちょっとコーラス入れてみたいんだ。", "zh": "是关于常规演出的我那首个人单曲。\n这次我想稍微加点和声进去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "f8a77e8e4ccab5a8c07cdf08ccd541bae5998c0097cc33dea531731b1dbfc51b", "ja": "プロデューサーに相談したら、\n二人に頼んでみろって言うんでね。", "zh": "我去找制作人商量了一下，他说让我试着拜托你们两个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7936b46641ab3c32b6863c1eadd22bf918240ce2a620f1fa083692afc40a824b", "ja": "わたし、オッケーでーす。\nちょうど今、パーッと歌いたかったし♪", "zh": "我完全OK～\n正好我现在也想痛痛快快地唱首歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "59577f26b0038758654b4a68bf0f1e169b70cbaed9bfd4ba82025077ad5f2cf2", "ja": "私も、やります。とても興味深いので。", "zh": "我也要参加。因为这非常有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "c53432bc479ffe5d352374e0b18201c6c06bd30b2273e391b06ff2ff1fa23ad4", "ja": "（そして、私と伊吹さんはジュリアさんの\nバックコーラスの練習を始めたのですが……）", "zh": "（然后，我和伊吹小姐开始练习为茱莉亚先生伴唱，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "bd4e863adedcf91a2ffd6931cb16272b37d137340eb6e7c727742ef46e712776", "ja": "だーかーら、そこビブラートかけなくていいって。\nアクセントも、あたしに合わせろって言っただろ？", "zh": "所——以——说了，那里不用加颤音。  \n我不是说过连重音也要跟我一致吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "c29f3f4537adcb66b825f6801b3bfa616a27b289f91644004f43077db63e977f", "ja": "翼はコーラス、メインボーカルはあたしなんだ。\n好き勝手歌うんじゃなくて、キッチリ合わせてくれ。", "zh": "翼唱和声，主唱是我。别想怎么唱就怎么唱，给我好好配合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "89b5d1e4881343e13e7a169085e35598348b54c3a594c6712957641f7baa5e8d", "ja": "う～ん、よく分かんないですけど……おっけ！", "zh": "嗯～虽然不是很明白……但没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "66ad83475e15959924e4eafd7b585d1f788f69f72e81687ff246a49a5cacbbd6", "ja": "おっけ！　じゃねーよ！　頭で理解しないと\nさっきから同じことの繰り返しだ。", "zh": "才不是一句“OK”就算了！不在脑子里理解的话，从刚才开始就一直在重复同样的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b9bf5d17b2e8e5e68a2f18509ea8317312f981bd950c5c411b2a55663eea02e6", "ja": "……ジュリアーノ、わたしちょっと疲れてきちゃった。\nそうだ♪　おやつ食べて来まーっす。", "zh": "……茱莉亚，我都开始有点累了。\n对了♪　我去吃点心啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "eddb87fe83f0682a29840e9a6bc9646a5c127db810d1498e41b5309504a2a370", "ja": "翼……。\nコーラスやると決めたのは自分だろ？", "zh": "翼……\n决定要唱和声的人是你自己吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "4fe352a62a0df806fcd77c04eb7dd4ef47b2e5157a1ad2cf18c3743cd399552f", "ja": "だったら、中途半端なことはするなよ。\nあたしはな、筋を通さないやつが1番嫌いなんだ。", "zh": "既然如此，就别做半吊子的事。  \n我啊，1讨厌不讲原则的家伙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1b8466ff1d95bd2ae6214607b3f9ef88e9c9ea861cecbd48d3dbd60f5e043f52", "ja": "……。この前から、あれは駄目、これは駄目って。\nそればっかり……。", "zh": "……。从刚才起就这也不行、那也不行的。\n光知道挑刺……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e9610c71c899038e986a7b78505d89a863634a21c14d4c6967945aa7d78ed74f", "ja": "休憩行って来まーす。", "zh": "我去休息一下，很快回来——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "47ffff0f647a7d1697c0ad1fd81963a5f9ec4adf16065246ffcc925e42444794", "ja": "！　おい！　翼！\nまだ話の途中だろ！？", "zh": "！喂！翼！\n话还没说完吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "2a78c598e9d8c7ff8a6a59c82bb31342f17c18a579634af7fda20c3119110790", "ja": "えいっ。", "zh": "嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1029_se", "source_sha256": "63c9f5e88213d4af9de0c89fedfd631ad20a508ecfc5be8976b5518463f6723d", "ja": "ポンッ！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "7c556b67ab91eb2184f67cfb0ed249f639f191bec985f7ed3d8442b82020409c", "ja": "マジックです。じゃじゃーん。", "zh": "这是魔术。锵锵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "f0766693ecd70feaa5f9070bd893f1c7f68f3252b214571e3d5f15e7138983b9", "ja": "伊吹さん、先日のオーディションで疲れてるんだと\n思います。今日はこの辺りで休憩しませんか？", "zh": "伊吹小姐，我想你一定是因为前几天的试镜累着了。今天就在这附近休息一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "a16ebae35d9624d5601e240108128c8c3bb9ad9b63237077670f15a72a8994c6", "ja": "……分かったよ。\nあたしも、頭冷やす。1時間休憩だ。", "zh": "……我知道了。\n我也去冷静一下。休息1小时。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "ea6b30a61cd4631dbc7e1df3a26259524026e3f07c6eee190f692ccd5756e74a", "ja": "（ライブの完成形を誰ひとり描けないまま、\n私たちは走り始めました。そして、とうとう……）", "zh": "（在谁都无法描绘出完美演出的最终模样时，\n我们就这样开始奔跑了。然后，终于……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_02_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "098c4c4b1940e23f2ac46a1328b4a660fe8da15c5dd5be16304f784067664071", "ja": "あぁ！？　遅刻ってどういうことだよ！", "zh": "啊！？迟到到底是怎么回事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
